Mahaparshva beheads and maims monkey chiefs --- Angada surges like full moon sea --- Angada fells Mahaparshva senseless from chariot --- Jambavan smashes his horses and chariot --- Mahaparshva revives and pierces Angada Jambavan Gavaksha --- Angada hurls whirling parigha and strips bow helmet --- Angada slaps his earringed ear with palm --- Mahaparshva hurls an axe into Angada shoulder --- Angada plants paternal fist upon his heart --- Demon heart bursts and Ravana rages